  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On Desktop, if you set a TMP InputField to line type \"Multiline Submit\" or \"Multiline NewLine\" and press enter in the keyboard interface, you can move the text up and down with the \"up/down\" arrows or \"W/S\" keys. Navigation has been set to None. This doesn not happen with \"Single Line\" line type.\n\nAs Single Line specifically does not allow for text wrapping, this is a problem for anyone who wants to make use of the multiline features of inputn fields as their text will fly away.\n\nThis does not seem to be a problem in VR, as the VRChat keyboard does not have a return key.",
